WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:16.860
Come, O Source of endless mercy,

2
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:23.320
Loose my tongue to sing Thy grace.

3
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:30.040
Streams of goodness, ever flowing,

4
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:36.380
Fill the hollows in this soul of mine.

5
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:43.020
I have tasted bitter waters,

6
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:49.580
Trying to satisfy the thirst.

7
00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:54.260
But the Shepherd’s voice spoke clearly—

8
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:02.800
Called this wandering stranger home.

9
00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:10.680
Come to Me, all worn and weary.

10
00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.360
Look to Me, and live.

11
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.860
Learn of Me — My grace sustains you.

12
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:33.840
Can you hear Me… calling your name?

13
00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:49.100
Now I speak in words of plainness:

14
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:54.040
With Thy help this far I’ve come.

15
00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:01.280
I hope by Thy tender mercy

16
00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:07.420
Safely to return back home.

17
00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:13.900
Far from Thee and full of questions,

18
00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:20.480
I knelt down and poured out my soul.

19
00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:27.480
He healed every empty place in me,

20
00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:31.760
Made my broken vessel whole.

21
00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:38.360
My arms are open.

22
00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:46.100
My wounded heart still beats for you.

23
00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:51.560
My hands will bless you.

24
00:02:51.700 --> 00:03:00.360
The marks of your worth remain on Me.

25
00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:32.000
By Thy goodness, I was found.

26
00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.400
Now I bear a joyful debt to carry!

27
00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:45.460
To Thy grace I am now bound.

28
00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:52.000
Turn now my wandering heart to Thee:

29
00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:58.360
Prone to wander, Lord, I feel it,

30
00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:05.040
Prone to leave the path You’ve shown;

31
00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:10.180
Here’s my soul — O take and seal it,

32
00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:18.480
Bring me to my heavenly home.

33
00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:23.480
Take My name upon you.

34
00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:31.520
The marks of your worth remain on Me.

35
00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.680
You are no stranger now—

36
00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:41.680
I call you by name.

37
00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:51.300
Bring my heavenly home to me,

38
00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:58.820
And bring me to my heavenly home.
